    <preface>
      <p></p>
      <p>Retirement Assistance for Farmers Scheme Extension Act 2000</p>
      <p>No. 118, 2000</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the <i>Social Security Act 1991</i> and the <i>Veterans’ Entitlements Act 1986</i></p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
      <p>2	Commencement	1</p>
      <p>3	Schedule(s)	2</p>
      <p>Schedule 1—Social Security Act 1991	3</p>
      <p>Schedule 2—Veterans’ Entitlements Act 1986	4</p>
      <p></p>
      <p><b>Retirement</b><b> Assistance for Farmers Scheme Extension Act 2000</b></p>
      <p><b>No. 118, 2000</b></p>
      <p>[<i>Assented to 7 September 2000</i>]</p>
      <formula name="enacting">
        <p>The Parliament of Australia enacts:</p>
      </formula>
