    <body>
      <section eId="sec-1">
        <num>1</num>
        <heading>Short title</heading>
        <content>
          <p>		This Act may be cited as the <i>Retirement Assistance for Farmers Scheme Extension Act 2000</i>.</p>
        </content>
      </section>
      <section eId="sec-2">
        <num>2</num>
        <heading>Commencement</heading>
        <content>
          <p>This Act commences on the day on which it receives the Royal Assent.</p>
        </content>
      </section>
      <section eId="sec-3">
        <num>3</num>
        <heading>Schedule(s)</heading>
        <content>
          <p>Each Act that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or repealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule concerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect according to its terms.</p>
          <p>Schedule 1—Social Security Act 1991</p>
          <p>1  Paragraph 1185B(1)(a)</p>
          <p>Omit “<date date="2000-09-15">15 September 2000</date>”, substitute “<date date="2001-07-01">1 July 2001</date>”.</p>
          <p>2  Subparagraph 1185B(1)(b)(ii)</p>
          <p>Omit “<date date="2000-09-15">15 September 2000</date>”, substitute “<date date="2001-07-01">1 July 2001</date>”.</p>
          <p>3  Paragraph 1185B(2)(a)</p>
          <p>Omit “<date date="2000-09-15">15 September 2000</date>”, substitute “<date date="2001-07-01">1 July 2001</date>”.</p>
          <p>4  Paragraph 1185B(2)(b)</p>
          <p>Omit “<date date="2000-09-15">15 September 2000</date>”, substitute “<date date="2001-07-01">1 July 2001</date>”.</p>
          <p>5  Paragraph 1185E(f)</p>
          <p>Omit “<date date="2000-09-15">15 September 2000</date>”, substitute “<date date="2001-07-01">1 July 2001</date>”.</p>
          <p>6  Paragraph 1185J(2)(b)</p>
          <p>Omit “<date date="2000-09-15">15 September 2000</date>”, substitute “<date date="2001-07-01">1 July 2001</date>”.</p>
          <p>Schedule 2—Veterans’ Entitlements Act 1986</p>
          <p>1  Paragraph 49A(1)(a)</p>
          <p>Omit “<date date="2000-09-15">15 September 2000</date>”, substitute “<date date="2001-07-01">1 July 2001</date>”.</p>
          <p>2  Subparagraph 49A(1)(b)(ii)</p>
          <p>Omit “<date date="2000-09-15">15 September 2000</date>”, substitute “<date date="2001-07-01">1 July 2001</date>”.</p>
          <p>3  Paragraph 49A(2)(a)</p>
          <p>Omit “<date date="2000-09-15">15 September 2000</date>”, substitute “<date date="2001-07-01">1 July 2001</date>”.</p>
          <p>4  Paragraph 49A(2)(b)</p>
          <p>Omit “<date date="2000-09-15">15 September 2000</date>”, substitute “<date date="2001-07-01">1 July 2001</date>”.</p>
          <p>5  Paragraph 49D(f)</p>
          <p>Omit “<date date="2000-09-15">15 September 2000</date>”, substitute “<date date="2001-07-01">1 July 2001</date>”.</p>
          <p>6  Paragraph 49H(2)(b)</p>
          <p>Omit “<date date="2000-09-15">15 September 2000</date>”, substitute “<date date="2001-07-01">1 July 2001</date>”.</p>
          <p>(108/00)</p>
          <p>[<i>Minister’s second reading speech made in—</i></p>
          <p><i>House of Representatives on 29 June 2000</i></p>
          <p><i>Senate on 16 August 2000</i>]</p>
        </content>
      </section>
